                        <field name="dc_title">St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 272 : Composite manuscript with theological works by Alcuin of York; also contains Alcuin’s Carmina 123 (Epitaphium Alcuini) and 112 (Dum sedeas laetus) </field>
